- A third-party app can provision a complete channel runtime in one SDK call.
- Foretic can register one workspace callback subscriber instead of one per channel.
- Repeated provisioning calls do not duplicate resources.
- Existing channel subscribers and individual create APIs are backward compatible.
- Unit tests cover new and old behavior.
- Deployed smoke tests prove one-call setup and workspace subscriber fanout.
- Docs and SDK docs are updated.
- A Foretic Cursor copy block is ready for the integration agent.
